1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
Here's a number secret!

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:04,380
Big friends are pairs that make ten together.

3
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:05,920
One and nine.

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,300
Two and eight.

5
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:08,840
Three and seven.

6
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,280
Four and six.

7
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:11,880
Five and five.

8
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:17,260
When the ones rod does not have enough beads to take away, a big friend comes to help!

9
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:19,080
Alert at the prize wall!

10
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,520
Eighty-five take away six is stuck!

11
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,680
There's not enough to take away six.

12
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:24,940
Let's call a friend!

13
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,540
Six's friend is four!

14
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:32,240
Add four, then take away ten!

15
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:35,260
Eighty-five take away six is seventy-nine!

16
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:36,620
Counter's good!

17
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,080
Sixty take away one is stuck!

18
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,220
There's not enough to take away one.

19
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:42,480
Friend, Spark!

20
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:46,960
One's friend is nine!

21
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,680
Add nine, then take away ten!

22
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:52,460
Sixty take away one is fifty-nine!

23
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:53,880
Ticket wall's steady!

24
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,600
Ninety-six take away eight is stuck!

25
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:57,960
Not enough there.

26
00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:59,040
One more friend!

27
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:03,240
Eight's friend is two!

28
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:05,820
Add two, then take away ten!

29
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:08,660
Ninety-six take away eight is eighty-eight!

30
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:09,800
Hang in there!

31
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:10,860
Last one!

32
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:13,400
Seventy-two take away three is stuck!

33
00:01:13,940 --> 00:01:14,820
Still not enough.

34
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:15,860
Final friend!

35
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:20,280
Three's friend is seven!

36
00:01:20,820 --> 00:01:22,980
Add seven, then take away ten!

37
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:26,080
Seventy-two take away three is sixty-nine!

38
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:28,380
Prize wall's open, jackpot!

39
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:30,540
Every stuck number has a trick.

